  "title": "HTML sup Tag - GeeksforGeeks",
  "content": "<div class=\"html-chunk\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The &lt;sup&gt; tag in HTML describes the text as a superscript text. Here the text is above the baseline of the text and that text appears in a smaller font.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Syntax:</strong></b></p><pre><span>&lt;sup&gt; Content... &lt;/sup&gt;</span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Example 1:</strong></b><span>&nbsp;</span></p><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">html</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"html\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-html\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">title</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">title</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span> <span class=\"na\">style</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"text-align: center;\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">h1</span> <span class=\"na\">style</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"color: green;\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> GeeksforGeeks <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">h1</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">h3</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>HTML <span class=\"ni\">&amp;lt;</span>sup<span class=\"ni\">&amp;gt;</span> Tag<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">h3</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>a<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">sup</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>2<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">sup</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Output:</strong></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img height=\"inherit\" src=\"./images/web-dev-080-img-1.png\" width=\"inherit\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Example 2:</strong></b><span>&nbsp;</span></p><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">html</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"html\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-html\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">title</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">title</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">style</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"nt\">sup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>\n<span class=\"w\">                    </span><span class=\"k\">vertical-align</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">super</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>\n<span class=\"w\">                    </span><span class=\"k\">font-size</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">medium</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">style</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> Examples to demonstrate superscript text <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>2 <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">sup</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>4<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">sup</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>=16<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>X <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">sup</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>4<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">sup</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>+ Y<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">sup</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>6<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">sup</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>9<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">sup</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>th<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">sup</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> of september<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> Change the default CSS settings to see the effect. <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Output:</strong></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img height=\"inherit\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./images/web-dev-080-img-2.png\" width=\"inherit\"></p></div>",
  "textContent": "The <sup> tag in HTML describes the text as a superscript text. Here the text is above the baseline of the text and that text appears in a smaller font.Syntax:<sup> Content... </sup>Example 1: \n            html\n\n    <!DOCTYPE html> \n<html> \n    <head> \n        <title></title> \n    </head> \n    <body style=\"text-align: center;\"> \n        <h1 style=\"color: green;\"> GeeksforGeeks </h1> \n        <h3>HTML &lt;sup&gt; Tag</h3> \n        <p>a<sup>2</sup></p> \n    </body> \n</html>\n\nOutput:Example 2: \n            html\n\n    <!DOCTYPE html> \n<html> \n    <head> \n        <title></title> \n        <style> \n            sup { \n                    vertical-align: super; \n                    font-size: medium; \n                } \n        </style> \n    </head> \n    <body> \n        <p> Examples to demonstrate superscript text </p> \n        <p>2 <sup>4</sup>=16</p> \n        <p>X <sup>4</sup>+ Y<sup>6</sup></p> \n        <p>9<sup>th</sup> of september</p> \n        <p> Change the default CSS settings to see the effect. </p> \n    </body> \n</html>\n\nOutput:",
  "url": "https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/html/html-sup-tag"
}
